Terminal 1: Launch Python/Streamlit Local Server
Activate Virtual Environment: venv\Scripts\activate

Ensure you have created the virtual environment and installed the required packages from requirements.txt.

Navigate to the Python Sub-directory: cd chatbot-interface
Launch Streamlit Silently: streamlit run chatbot.py --server.headless true

Terminal 2: Launch Java/Spring/Tomcat Local Server
Navigate to the main application class: \smartcasemanager\src\main\java\com\smart and run the application.

🌈 Enjoy the Features!
User Account Management: Create, view, modify, and delete user accounts.
Case Record Management: Add, view, and delete case records.
GenAI Chatbot: Get instant assistance with the integrated chatbot interface.

🎉 Get Started Today!
Dive into the world of efficient case management with Smart Case Manager. Whether you are an advocate or a developer, this project is built to simplify your workflow and enhance productivity.

Feel free to modify the sections as per your preference to make it more aligned with your project goals and style.


