│ └── data.json # Movie + showtime data 
├── .env # API keys and config 
└── README.md 

## 📄 Install dependencies
- pip install -r requirements.txt

## 🧭 Start the server (running on HTTP)
- python server.py

## 🌐 Launch CLI assistant (Custom Elicitation)
