🎬 Movies:
- Inception (Sci-Fi) [mov001] in Delhi
- Dune (Adventure) [mov002] in Delhi

You: Showtimes for Inception in Delhi
✅ Detected intent: get_showtimes
✅ Params: {'movie_name': 'Inception', 'location': 'Delhi'}
