run_trees.py,env/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_trees.py,f52dda1c19fd587eaea03def6ed60fde1747e702,Mustafa-Shoukat1/Cold-Email-Generator-with-Llama-3.2,https://api.github.com/repositories/866162900/contents/env/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_trees.py?ref=f418fb00ebc1ed47391a628c581a0dcb446b6351,https://api.github.com/repositories/866162900/git/blobs/f52dda1c19fd587eaea03def6ed60fde1747e702,https://github.com/Mustafa-Shoukat1/Cold-Email-Generator-with-Llama-3.2/blob/f418fb00ebc1ed47391a628c581a0dcb446b6351/env/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_trees.py,,,0,0,2,19,2024-10-09T19:08:46Z,1,0,"# 📧 Cold Mail Generator with LLama 3.2

Cold email generator for services companies using Groq, Langchain, Streamlit, and Llama 3.2. It allows users to input the URL of a company's careers page. The tool then extracts job listings from that page and generates personalized cold emails. These emails include relevant portfolio links sourced from a vector database, based on the specific job descriptions.  

** Scenario:**
