smart_sales_agent.py,src/services/smart_sales_agent.py,02254887d6b50040ed63c198aa9bc97828ecb1c1,frfahim/smart-sell,https://api.github.com/repositories/1047389503/contents/src/services/smart_sales_agent.py?ref=49bffd4077ecdcffb58878f30d51f71f9e77a17b,https://api.github.com/repositories/1047389503/git/blobs/02254887d6b50040ed63c198aa9bc97828ecb1c1,https://github.com/frfahim/smart-sell/blob/49bffd4077ecdcffb58878f30d51f71f9e77a17b/src/services/smart_sales_agent.py,,,0,0,0,2,2025-08-30T10:11:37Z,0,0,"# Smart-Sells: AI-Powered Shopping Automation

## Introduction
Smart-Sells is an AI-powered conversational assistant designed to automate and enhance the regular shopping experience. Customers interact with the system via chat, where the agent intelligently guides them through product discovery, selection, and order placement. The solution is built for modern sales teams and e-commerce businesses, supporting multilingual conversations and seamless integration with product and order management workflows.

## Tech Stack
- **Python**
- **LangChain** (LLM integration, conversational flows, semantic search)
- **OpenAI** (LLM and embeddings)
- **Streamlit** (interactive chat UI)
- **FastAPI** (API endpoints for chat simulation and backend services)
- **SQLite** (persistent storage for products, orders, and FAQs)
- **ChromaDB** (vector database for semantic product and FAQ search)

## Core Features
1. **Conversational Interface**
   - Real-time chat with natural language understanding
   - Multilingual support: English, Bengali, Banglish

2. **Product Search & Recommendation**
   - Semantic search by name, category, or description
   - Personalized recommendations based on user preferences and history

3. **Product Selection**
   - Add/remove products to a virtual cart
   - View cart summary and product details (images, prices)

4. **Order Placement**
   - Conversational collection of customer details (name, address, contact)
   - AI-guided checkout and confirmation

5. **Order Confirmation**
   - Simulate order placement and store in database
   - Provide order summary and confirmation message

6. **FAQ & Policy Handling**
   - Automated responses to common queries (delivery, payment, refund, etc.)
   - Vector search for business FAQs

7. **Seller Tools**
   - Track unanswered queries
   - Dynamic intent tuning and prompt updates

## Suggested Enhancements
- Integrate payment simulation (mock)
- Add order history for returning customers
- Modular code structure for easy extension (e.g., real webhooks, external APIs)

