base.py,ipfs_embeddings_py/llama_index/legacy/prompts/base.py,6133057e69359d92476a26e3630e1ed5a4e88705,endomorphosis/laion-embeddings,https://api.github.com/repositories/852658380/contents/ipfs_embeddings_py/llama_index/legacy/prompts/base.py?ref=67a92ed506fc0d9e957743bce58f77f5fa6ef885,https://api.github.com/repositories/852658380/git/blobs/6133057e69359d92476a26e3630e1ed5a4e88705,https://github.com/endomorphosis/laion-embeddings/blob/67a92ed506fc0d9e957743bce58f77f5fa6ef885/ipfs_embeddings_py/llama_index/legacy/prompts/base.py,code for Juwels and Gaudi,,0,0,4,555,2025-06-07T08:33:07Z,1,1,"# LAION Embeddings - IPFS-Based Embeddings Search Engine

An advanced, production-ready IPFS-based embeddings search engine that provides FastAPI endpoints for creating, searching, and managing embeddings using multiple ML models and storage backends. Features comprehensive Model Context Protocol (MCP) integration with 40+ tools for AI assistant access.

## 🎉 Project Status: PRODUCTION READY

**✅ Codebase Fully Tested & Validated** - All pytest issues resolved and comprehensive fixes applied  
**✅ Directory Structure Organized** - Clean, professional project organization completed  
