config.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/runnables/config.py,f1bf2f65006565d95014c0094cb939f3c796d81f,SinghRaghvendra/NPCI_App,https://api.github.com/repositories/1004289623/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/runnables/config.py?ref=a27c41680b1d3c2a9ada87e23368e160f8efca1d,https://api.github.com/repositories/1004289623/git/blobs/f1bf2f65006565d95014c0094cb939f3c796d81f,https://github.com/SinghRaghvendra/NPCI_App/blob/a27c41680b1d3c2a9ada87e23368e160f8efca1d/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/runnables/config.py,,,0,0,0,2,2025-06-18T13:04:16Z,0,0,"# 🏦 NPCI FAQ & Circular Assistant

A simple end-to-end RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) application that answers NPCI-related queries using:
- ✅ **Google Gemini LLM**
- ✅ **LangChain** for chaining RAG steps
- ✅ **Web Scraping** for fresh data
- ✅ **Pinecone Vector Database** for storing embeddings
- ✅ **Streamlit** for an interactive web UI

---

## 🚀 **Features**

- 🔍 **Web Scraping**: Scrapes NPCI FAQ or circulars from the NPCI website.
- 🧠 **RAG Pipeline**: Uses Pinecone to store embeddings and retrieves relevant context.
- 🤖 **LLM Answering**: Google Gemini generates final answers using retrieved context.
- 🌐 **Streamlit UI**: Simple chat-like interface to ask questions.

---

## ⚙️ **Tech Stack**

| Component  | Tool |
|------------|------|
| LLM | Google Gemini |
| RAG | LangChain |
| Vector DB | Pinecone |
| Embeddings | Google Generative AI Embeddings |
| Web Framework | Streamlit |
| Scraping | BeautifulSoup |

---

