run_trees.py,AIML/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_trees.py,63f0cb4e508274e25832a01d9db47418932cff34,priyansi032005/Repobot_SGP-IV,https://api.github.com/repositories/910329297/contents/AIML/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_trees.py?ref=65e293f4326f50118ea8360d2d95051fb6ee6d99,https://api.github.com/repositories/910329297/git/blobs/63f0cb4e508274e25832a01d9db47418932cff34,https://github.com/priyansi032005/Repobot_SGP-IV/blob/65e293f4326f50118ea8360d2d95051fb6ee6d99/AIML/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_trees.py,,,0,0,0,65,2025-05-01T16:02:31Z,0,3,"# 🚀 RepoBot - GitHub Repository Manager

## 🤖 About RepoBot
RepoBot is an **NLP-based chatbot** designed to make **GitHub repository management**. It allows users to interact with their repositories through **natural language commands**, making it easier to fetch repo details, manage branches, track issues, and more.

## ✨ Features
- 🗣 **NLP-based Chatbot** – Manage repositories using natural language.
- 🔐 **Secure Authentication** – Login & access repos securely.
- 📂 **Repository Management** – summary of github task 

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- **Frontend:** React.js, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js
- **Database:** MongoDB
- **NLP:** Python, NLP Libraries
- **Authentication:** JWT / OAuth

## 🚀 Getting Started
### 🔧 Installation
```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/priyansi032005/Repobot_SGP-IV.git
cd Repobot_SGP-IV

# Install dependencies
npm install   # For backend
```

### ⚡ Usage
```bash
# Start backend server
cd backend
nodemon server.js

# Start frontend
cd frontend
npm run dev
```

## 📸 Screenshots
![Repobot Landing page](Frontend/src/assets/Screenshot%20(115).png)
![Chatbot Demo](Frontend/src/assets/Screenshot%20(119).png)

## 👥 Contributors
- **Priyansi** - Full stack & ML developer
- **Melita** - Full stack & ML developer
- **Hasti** - Frontend & Security Developer

## 🚀 Future Enhancements
- ✅ Voice command support
- ✅ AI-based repo suggestions
- ✅ Integration with more platforms

