## Quick Start

**Get up and running in 3 commands:**

```bash
git clone https://github.com/redis-developer/redis-rag-workbench.git
cd redis-rag-workbench
make setup && make dev
```

Then visit `http://localhost:8000` and start chatting with your PDFs! 🎉

