│   ├── tools.py                    # Tool definitions for Assistant API
│   ├── RAG_functions.py            # RAG processing utilities
│   ├── order_database_functions.py # Order lookup utilities
│   └── generic_functions.py        # Helper functions
├── evaluation/
│   ├── assistant_pipeline_evaluation_order.py
│   ├── assistant_pipeline_evaluation_rag.py
│   ├── evaluation_order_pipeline.py
│   └── evaluation_rag_pipeline.py
└── test_data/                      # Test datasets and knowledge base
```

---

## Security Features

- **Role-based restrictions**: Assistant stays in character as customer service agent  
- **Input validation**: Prevents system prompt injection and unauthorized queries  
- **Secure API key handling**: Environment-based configuration  
- **Error boundaries**: Comprehensive exception handling  

---

## Future Work & Outlook

- Multi-language support for international customer service  
- Integration with CRM systems for enhanced order management  
- Voice interface using speech-to-text and text-to-speech  
- Advanced analytics for customer interaction insights  
- Automated escalation to human agents for complex issues  
- Real-time order updates through webhook integration  

