callbacks.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/posthog/ai/langchain/callbacks.py,fc2fe9d83db83792feaed7d21919032abd65915a,mdesoky-4473/openbb-finance-app,https://api.github.com/repositories/931058975/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/posthog/ai/langchain/callbacks.py?ref=1deaecd1beb57b33b98a6c179d179e9fa618b0cb,https://api.github.com/repositories/931058975/git/blobs/fc2fe9d83db83792feaed7d21919032abd65915a,https://github.com/mdesoky-4473/openbb-finance-app/blob/1deaecd1beb57b33b98a6c179d179e9fa618b0cb/venv/Lib/site-packages/posthog/ai/langchain/callbacks.py,An introductory application leveraging the OpenBB platform.,,1,0,0,3,2025-02-11T17:05:34Z,0,0,"# 📈 OpenBB Finance App

Welcome to the **OpenBB Finance App**, a simple, user-friendly web application that allows you to fetch real-time stock data and the latest financial news using the OpenBB platform.

## 🚀 Features

- **Real-Time Stock Data:** View open, high, low, close prices, and trading volumes for your favorite stocks.
- **Latest Financial News:** Stay updated with the latest headlines related to the stock you search for.
- **Clean UI:** Easy-to-use interface for quick insights.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Backend:** FastAPI (Python)
- **Frontend:** HTML/CSS (Jinja2 Templates)
- **Data Source:** OpenBB SDK
- **Deployment Ready:** Easily deployable on any server or cloud platform.

## 📦 Installation

1. **Clone the Repository:**
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/mdesoky-4473/openbb-finance-app.git
   cd openbb-finance-app


2. **Set Up a Virtual Environment:**

    bash
    python -m venv venv
    # Activate the virtual environment:
    # On Windows:
    venv\Scripts\activate
    # On Mac/Linux:
    source venv/bin/activate

3. **Install Dependencies:**

    bash
    pip install -r requirements.txt

## Running the App
    bash
    uvicorn app.main:app --reload"
