## 🐛 Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

#### Installation Issues
```bash
# Problem: Tesseract not found
# Solution: Install Tesseract and add to PATH
export TESSERACT_CMD='/usr/local/bin/tesseract'

# Problem: Model download fails
# Solution: Manual download
python -c ""import sentence_transformers; sentence_transformers.SentenceTransformer('distiluse-base-multilingual-cased-v2')""
```

#### Runtime Issues
```bash
# Problem: Database locked
# Solution: Check for running processes
ps aux | grep python
kill <process_id>

# Problem: Memory issues
# Solution: Reduce batch size in config
# Edit config/config.yaml:
# models:
#   embedding:
#     batch_size: 16  # Reduce from 32
```

#### Performance Issues
```bash
# Problem: Slow processing
# Solution: Enable GPU support
pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118

# Problem: Large memory usage
# Solution: Process documents in smaller batches
# Adjust chunk_size in configuration
```

### Debug Mode
```bash
# Enable debug logging
export LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG

# Run with verbose output
python streamlit_app.py --debug
```

### Support
- **Issues**: [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/uskudar-municipality/pdf-analysis/issues)
- **Documentation**: [Wiki](https://github.com/uskudar-municipality/pdf-analysis/wiki)
- **Email**: support@uskudar.gov.tr

